        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to PixelTorque — The Underground Pixel Racing Revolution.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/6ceaab69de7c8d79eabc72992703c018.avif?t=1766562044\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a neon-soaked world where every race counts and every upgrade matters. Build your dream ride, tune its performance, and challenge elite racers in high-speed drag duels that test your timing, precision, and nerve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>Amal</strong>, a passionate street racer, your journey begins with a simple goal — to prove yourself on the toughest pixel tracks. But when a mysterious rival threatens your crew, every race becomes a step closer to uncovering the truth behind the city’s underground circuit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/034036c6926c8bace6b275ecb55892f4.poster.avif?t=1766562044\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/034036c6926c8bace6b275ecb55892f4.webm?t=1766562044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/034036c6926c8bace6b275ecb55892f4.mp4?t=1766562044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ <strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏁 <strong>Authentic 2D Drag Racing:</strong> Shift gears manually, control throttle, and master launch timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚗 <strong>Deep Car Customisation:</strong> Swap engines, upgrade turbos, tune gear ratios, and change visuals to match your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Retro Pixel Aesthetics:</strong> Beautiful pixel-art visuals inspired by 90s arcade racers, reimagined for modern displays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 <strong>Garage System:</strong> Buy, sell, and manage your cars — build your collection and optimise for different race types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⛽ <strong>Fuel Management:</strong> Plan your runs carefully — fuel isn’t infinite!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌆 <strong>Dynamic Locations:</strong> Race through city streets, industrial zones, and neon highways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Story Mode:</strong> Face four racing champions and uncover a secret that fuels the underground racing scene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Multiplayer :</strong> Compete against other racers online and climb the global leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Controller Support:</strong> Plug in and race with full controller support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ <strong>Future Roadmap:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mobile version (Android &amp; iOS)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded multiplayer &amp; crew battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal tournaments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community garage events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PixelTorque</strong> blends old-school pixel charm with modern-day realism — a love letter to every car enthusiast who ever dreamt of building the ultimate racing machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow us for updates:</strong><br>🌐 <br>💬 Discord: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive. Tune. Dominate.</strong><br>Welcome to <i>PixelTorque</i> — where every pixel burns rubber !</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to PixelTorque — The Underground Pixel Racing Revolution.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/6ceaab69de7c8d79eabc72992703c018.avif?t=1766562044\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a neon-soaked world where every race counts and every upgrade matters. Build your dream ride, tune its performance, and challenge elite racers in high-speed drag duels that test your timing, precision, and nerve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>Amal</strong>, a passionate street racer, your journey begins with a simple goal — to prove yourself on the toughest pixel tracks. But when a mysterious rival threatens your crew, every race becomes a step closer to uncovering the truth behind the city’s underground circuit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/034036c6926c8bace6b275ecb55892f4.poster.avif?t=1766562044\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/034036c6926c8bace6b275ecb55892f4.webm?t=1766562044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/034036c6926c8bace6b275ecb55892f4.mp4?t=1766562044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ <strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏁 <strong>Authentic 2D Drag Racing:</strong> Shift gears manually, control throttle, and master launch timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚗 <strong>Deep Car Customisation:</strong> Swap engines, upgrade turbos, tune gear ratios, and change visuals to match your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Retro Pixel Aesthetics:</strong> Beautiful pixel-art visuals inspired by 90s arcade racers, reimagined for modern displays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 <strong>Garage System:</strong> Buy, sell, and manage your cars — build your collection and optimise for different race types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⛽ <strong>Fuel Management:</strong> Plan your runs carefully — fuel isn’t infinite!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌆 <strong>Dynamic Locations:</strong> Race through city streets, industrial zones, and neon highways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Story Mode:</strong> Face four racing champions and uncover a secret that fuels the underground racing scene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Multiplayer :</strong> Compete against other racers online and climb the global leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Controller Support:</strong> Plug in and race with full controller support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ <strong>Future Roadmap:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mobile version (Android &amp; iOS)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded multiplayer &amp; crew battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal tournaments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community garage events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PixelTorque</strong> blends old-school pixel charm with modern-day realism — a love letter to every car enthusiast who ever dreamt of building the ultimate racing machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow us for updates:</strong><br>🌐 <br>💬 Discord: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive. Tune. Dominate.</strong><br>Welcome to <i>PixelTorque</i> — where every pixel burns rubber !</p>",
